                <airSeal>At the time of the inspection we notice some air leakage on the following house components:

-Receptacles

-Back door

-Crawl space

The infiltration test result has shown a low air leakage. The replacement and the addition of weatherstripping should help to increase the airtightness of the components listed above.

</airSeal>
